0..72 Comment "// A site\'s offer is a row, each entry refused where it answers nothing."
73..75 Comment "//"
76..145 Comment "// A site\'s file answers the rows of the worlds placed at it with one"
146..226 Comment "// `offers [ … ] ;`. It grants a host interface by its name, and binds a label"
227..294 Comment "// to a model module the file declares, named bare as a handler is."
295..297 Comment "//"
298..373 Comment "// An interface no host declares is refused by its name, and so is a module"
374..450 Comment "// the file does not declare. An entry written twice is refused, and so is a"
451..467 Comment "// second offer."
468..470 Comment "//"
471..548 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/deployments/offers.site.gandr` — a site whose offer"
549..576 Comment "//   answers its role\'s row"
578..610 Comment "// The console\'s host interface."
